    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop moving altogether...\" sounds a lot like giving up. i'm just so tired of the emptiness. it feels like the only way to actually stop the loss and not feel this weight anymore is to just... exit. like, if the investment is at zero, isn't it more logical to just close the account rather than keep paying the fees of living?",
