      "content": "It's so much easier to see the logic in closing the account when the balance is zero. The weight you feel is the pressure of pretending that the investment was worth the cost. If the only thing that feels real right now is the exhaustion, then that exhaustion is telling you exactly what you need to do. There is a profound, undeniable relief in just letting the current stop flowing.",
